Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,ПРЕДСТ,,0,0,0,,ФАНСАБ-ГРУППА АЗАЛИИ ПРЕДСТАВЛЯЕТ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fade(00,0)\p1\a5\bord0\1a&H00&\pos(430,206)\fscx807\fscy277}m 0 0 l 0 0 l 92 0 l 92 38 l 0 38
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,worked,,0,0,0,,{\pos(801,256)}Worked on the series:\N Lily, Tiramisu, Biryulka, Host, Hazelnut, February
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,title,,0,0,0,,{\fscx75\fscy75\pos(846,392)}How I became
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,name,,0,0,0,,{\fscx75\fscy75\pos(848,456)}queen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.06,2:01:37.06,PRESENT,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(1181,4)}AZALEA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.06,0:01:06.33,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,All characters are fictitious,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.33,0:01:08.61,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,and the events shown are fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.57,0:01:11.94,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,If you don’t want to talk,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.94,0:01:13.81,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,use hand signals?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.81,0:01:14.81,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,For example, this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.78,0:01:16.98,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.98,0:01:20.25,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This means that I’m lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.68,0:01:22.68,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What do you say? It's not difficult, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.19,0:01:31.02,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The king never lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.00,0:01:36.93,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,15 episode
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.35,0:01:58.12,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What sin could such a young child commit?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.05,0:02:02.46,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The smell of alcohol and something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.36,0:02:04.69,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,She did not drink the poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.93,0:02:11.63,Default,Lilia,0,0,0,,I can’t believe she was forced to drink poison by those tiny hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.47,0:02:15.97,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Warm hands. She's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.14,0:02:24.38,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.21,0:02:27.45,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Damhyang!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.49,0:02:32.52,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.00,0:02:48.80,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Mr.\N-You are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.80,0:02:49.90,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:52.07,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.51,0:02:59.15,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You cannot leave a child in the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.45,0:03:02.65,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I have to give her a funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.66,0:03:14.86,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Goodbye.\N-Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.12,0:03:37.18,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,How is Damhyan? Is she okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.48,0:03:39.89,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,She has already left the palace safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.62,0:03:42.82,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I had mercy on her servant mother
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.82,0:03:45.73,Default,Lilia,0,0,0,,and prepared everything for them to leave Hanyang together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.73,0:03:47.13,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,So she will meet her mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.93,0:03:50.06,Default,Lilia,0,0,0,,Damhyan was very worried about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.53,0:03:52.93,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What a joy. This is cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.17,0:03:58.74,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,How did you pull this off? Did you give her sleeping pills?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.77,0:04:00.34,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,They gave her mafeisan to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.48,0:04:05.08,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Mafeisan, what did Hua Tuo use during operations?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.08,0:04:06.35,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.35,0:04:09.02,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Of course. I have read The Three Kingdoms for Children many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.62,0:04:11.32,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The Three Kingdoms for children?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.09,0:04:16.42,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Listen. You should have warned me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.42,0:04:18.23,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The matter was urgent,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.23,0:04:20.23,Default,Lilia,0,0,0,,it was dangerous to involve a lot of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.20,0:04:27.27,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Any word from Mr. Hong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.47,0:04:31.04,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Yes. He made sure the child escaped safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.94,0:04:34.34,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.38,0:04:38.58,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Recklessly expose yourself to danger
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.98,0:04:40.38,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,because of the maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.55,0:04:42.32,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,She's not just a servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.38,0:04:44.92,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,If I gave up the child,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.02,0:04:48.39,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,it would be easier to give up 10, 100,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.12,0:04:52.49,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,and then all my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.66,0:04:57.10,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I thought Cheoljong was an ordinary fool,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.00,0:05:00.47,Default,Lilia,0,0,0,,and he’s just an incredible fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.53,0:05:02.97,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Don't spend a lot of time thinking about great things.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.97,0:05:04.17,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Otherwise you won’t live long.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.77,0:05:07.37,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I do not intend to live a miserable life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.37,0:05:09.41,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,An excellent excuse for an early death.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.88,0:05:11.51,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Who is he...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.51,0:05:12.98,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,She is the one who thanks me so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.01,0:05:16.92,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The Queen speaks differently than others.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.52,0:05:21.42,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,"The Queen's Dictionary" came in handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.42,0:05:23.52,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It is full of free and incorrect translations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.52,0:05:25.66,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Did you see it?\N-You left it open.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.69,0:05:30.26,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,By the way, is the queen’s position always so dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.26,0:05:32.13,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Why does everyone want to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.47,0:05:35.60,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I won't let this happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.67,0:05:38.87,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,No. I'll take care of everything myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.74,0:05:41.74,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The best defense is an attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.71,0:05:47.05,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,From this day on, I will become the most reckless one in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.76,0:06:05.77,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Crazy X is here
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.47,0:06:14.77,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Have you tried to get rid of the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.34,0:06:17.44,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The queen is on the side of the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.44,0:06:20.35,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,She told him about all the weaknesses of our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.88,0:06:23.38,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Fell in love with the king and turned away from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.08,0:06:25.52,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This is not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.35,0:06:28.09,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You don’t want to believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.62,0:06:31.26,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,that the queen you adore
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.26,0:06:33.06,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,just a stupid woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.06,0:06:34.83,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,recklessly in love with a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.83,0:06:37.80,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Joining your family,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.80,0:06:40.67,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I did everything you wanted to be accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.34,0:06:44.91,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Not just to stay in this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.57,0:06:47.11,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I wanted to be like you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.14,0:06:49.88,Default,Lilia,0,0,0,,had respect for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.78,0:06:54.48,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,But trying to harm the queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.02,0:06:58.29,Default,Lilia,0,0,0,,you are no longer my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.02,0:07:04.22,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,If anyone decides to threaten the queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.89,0:07:09.20,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I will definitely cut his throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.94,0:07:17.00,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You can come home whenever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.01,0:07:21.44,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Even if you don’t consider me a father,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.64,0:07:24.98,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,you will always be my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.86,0:07:40.16,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Who could have hidden the ledger in Daejojeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.69,0:07:42.73,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The main suspects are
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.73,0:07:44.76,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,those two who bear a grudge against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.47,0:07:47.27,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The Queen Mother and Cho Hwajin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.67,0:07:50.17,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The motive points to Cho Hwajin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.04,0:08:00.95,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I'm almost sure, considering how she behaved during the hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.65,0:08:05.85,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,However, Hwajin has not come to Daejojon for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.19,0:08:08.79,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Methods point to the Queen Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.36,0:08:11.52,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.66,0:08:16.36,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,She comes here suspiciously often lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.50,0:08:19.40,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Of course, she also has a motive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.50,0:08:21.80,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Is this the Queen Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.24,0:08:23.80,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,This little rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.54,0:08:29.64,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,How did the Queen Mother get her hands on the ledger?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.18,0:08:35.68,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,That’s the mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.15,0:08:40.59,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,More importantly, what kind of ledger is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.84,0:09:04.91,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Today I did not perform the ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.91,0:09:07.35,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I apologize for my rude behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.02,0:09:11.38,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You’re apologizing for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.35,0:09:13.89,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What is the reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.82,0:09:16.66,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,As I expected,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.92,0:09:19.96,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,you grasp everything on the fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.53,0:09:31.37,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Thank you for participating in this unpleasant meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.11,0:09:37.74,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I'm sure you understand in light of recent events,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.74,0:09:39.51,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,that the time has come for the nobility
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.51,0:09:41.31,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,unite families.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.25,0:09:43.52,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,We are closely connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.75,0:09:46.89,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,If one of the two families falls,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.22,0:09:49.32,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,other will not stay afloat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.66,0:09:57.10,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Therefore, I propose to issue a decree on amnesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.96,0:09:59.50,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,as a guarantee of harmony in relationships.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.87,0:10:02.07,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Decree?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.07,0:10:04.30,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Many talents from both families
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.30,0:10:07.34,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,lost their posts due to a momentary error.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.84,0:10:11.44,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,We will issue an amnesty decree to pardon these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.55,0:10:15.52,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,In other words, it is a symbol of promise
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.52,0:10:17.05,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,and a congratulatory gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.55,0:10:18.69,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.39,0:10:22.16,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Support me on this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.32,0:10:54.22,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The War Department used dirty tricks to satisfy its greed,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.22,0:10:58.26,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,and I am guilty of not being able to subdue him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.89,0:11:01.59,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,In this regard, I, Kim Jwageun,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.40,0:11:05.53,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I ask for resignation from my post.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.94,0:11:14.44,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It’s not over for me yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.87,0:11:16.84,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It won’t end while I’m breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.66,0:11:39.13,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Eat slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.47,0:11:43.04,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Are there enough snacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.35,0:11:56.25,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I shouldn’t eat if I have even a drop of shame left in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.52,0:12:02.29,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,So why did you run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.76,0:12:06.23,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I treated you well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.10,0:12:10.30,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,The thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.54,0:12:20.37,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.91,0:12:23.18,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.58,0:12:24.71,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.38,0:12:29.15,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You have suffered enough, Damhyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.82,0:12:31.75,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It was hard for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.13,0:12:44.50,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Everything is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.17,0:12:48.30,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Everything will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.64,0:12:59.08,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,We try to smile in front of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.61,0:13:01.58,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Her Majesty should not
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.58,0:13:03.32,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,to be sad for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.98,0:13:05.02,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.80,0:13:24.64,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty. It's time to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.55,0:13:34.75,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.25,0:13:39.19,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You couldn't sleep last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.19,0:13:43.16,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I'm worried that you'll get yourself into trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.72,0:13:48.59,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Too many thoughts, I couldn’t sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.86,0:13:53.27,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,By the way, did they sleep well anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.03,0:13:55.54,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.54,0:13:57.74,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Those people who tried to ruin my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.20,0:14:00.64,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It was their last peaceful sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.04,0:14:02.61,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I hope they got enough sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.75,0:14:07.41,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Lady Choi.\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.58,0:14:09.08,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Send someone
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.08,0:14:10.98,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,for my father, let him come to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.12,0:14:12.35,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.70,0:14:24.83,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.37,0:14:28.00,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Your father has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.97,0:14:29.97,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Already?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.91,0:14:38.11,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,I was going to ask you to come to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.15,0:14:41.98,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,But you have already arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.98,0:14:43.08,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.32,0:14:47.72,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,It seems that I came for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.79,0:14:53.19,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Last time...\N-Last time...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.13,0:14:55.43,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,You speak first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.43,0:14:57.33,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,No. You speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.33,0:14:59.77,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,No. You speak first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.14,0:15:06.71,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Sorry about that time.\N-Sorry about that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.71,0:15:08.64,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-No. First, I'll apologize.\N-No. Me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.64,0:15:10.01,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-Me first.\N-No, me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.01,0:15:11.28,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,-God.\N-Me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.19,0:15:23.26,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Yes, blood is not water.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.66,0:15:25.96,Default,Lily,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.06,0:15:31.60,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,I called you today
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.87,0:15:34.23,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,due to the ledger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.44,0:15:40.24,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,-Did you know?\N-Everyone went crazy because of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.87,0:15:42.44,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,What kind of book is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.51,0:15:50.65,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,This is an account of the illegal activities of our clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.32,0:15:53.22,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,The weak point of the Andong Kim clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.42,0:15:56.16,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,That's why Cheoljong wanted to get her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.16,0:16:00.26,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,Today I just came to talk about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.19,0:16:04.23,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,After your visit with the king, she disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.70,0:16:07.23,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,So all this time I suspected the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.30,0:16:09.47,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,But recently
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.77,0:16:12.51,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,my faithful servant, whom I doted on, escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.47,0:16:16.08,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,Fortunately, I caught it and found out the reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.24,0:16:18.91,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,The day before the disappearance
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.71,0:16:21.78,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,he let in concubine Cho.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.42,0:16:25.59,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,When there was a fuss at home,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.89,0:16:28.79,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,he thought that everything was because of him and ran away. Therefore...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.16,0:16:32.39,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.46,0:16:37.80,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.80,0:16:40.87,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,Here
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.17,0:16:44.27,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,and our riddle was solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.07,0:16:47.14,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.31,0:16:49.98,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,Sungwon was the initiator of my murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.94,0:16:53.48,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,I specially prepared ice,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.48,0:16:55.98,Default,hazelnuts,0,0,0,,which is more expensive than gold today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.62,0:17:00.95,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,The Queen Mother mocked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.39,0:17:03.02,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,I will serve you my food someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.02,0:17:04.52,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,I should try it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.46,0:17:12.17,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,And Cho Hwajin provided the weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.30,0:17:14.17,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,Confess everything to the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.17,0:17:15.40,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,Are you threatening me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.80,0:17:18.20,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,I you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.44,0:17:20.67,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,heard clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.95,0:17:34.62,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,Father, I need to go somewhere now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.49,0:17:36.56,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.62,0:17:40.09,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,Open the door to the fiery pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.86,0:17:45.70,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,You will regret contacting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.54,0:17:53.17,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,She used to be as obedient as a lamb.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.61,0:17:56.34,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,And in a short time it became cruel here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.54,0:18:00.08,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,I know that parents cannot be objective towards their children.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.31,0:18:01.65,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,But a lamb?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.58,0:18:04.42,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,If I compared her to an animal,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.42,0:18:06.25,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,then only with tarpan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.55,0:18:10.12,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,My daughter is a Tarpan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.78,0:18:32.25,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,Maori tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.55,0:18:35.18,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,Peacock feather.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.78,0:18:37.85,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,And the devil wears Prada.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.75,0:18:40.65,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,Strength in beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.42,0:18:46.09,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,Today I have the most beautiful armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.36,0:18:48.43,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,How do you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.40,0:18:51.43,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,Like.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.87,0:18:54.93,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,Revenge is sweet when served with fireworks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.43,0:19:21.53,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,What does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.06,0:19:24.13,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,What you see is not everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.28,0:19:38.88,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,To find out what's inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.88,0:19:41.18,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,needs to be cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.35,0:19:43.52,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,I thought it was just potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.32,0:19:47.22,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,But you tricked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.22,0:19:50.02,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,You shouldn’t lose trust without a good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.32,0:19:53.33,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,Before you cut, you need to make sure that it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.79,0:19:58.56,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,Because after that you can’t return anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.00,0:20:02.17,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,Your drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.42,0:20:23.12,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,Today I prepared brunch,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.32,0:20:26.43,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,to thank you for the recent
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.69,0:20:28.53,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,wonderful breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.96,0:20:33.07,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,The cool drink at last brunch was so wonderful,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.27,0:20:36.87,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,that I wouldn’t even notice someone’s death.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.88,0:20:46.05,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,Try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.28,0:20:53.22,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,I'm not thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.22,0:20:55.82,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,I put so much effort into it. Take at least a sip.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.82,0:20:57.46,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,I told you I don’t want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.36,0:21:00.99,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,I tried so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.40,0:21:04.83,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,If you don’t want to drink...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.82,0:21:26.15,Default,hazelnuts,0,0,0,,It really tastes better with ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.12,0:21:31.86,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,I said earlier that I would help you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.36,0:21:35.33,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,stay healthy and young for the rest of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.96,0:21:38.50,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,And I will continue to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.17,0:21:42.10,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,If you doubt food, drinks and everything around,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.94,0:21:44.87,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,then life will turn into nothing but suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.00,0:21:46.84,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,Since my regency is over,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.84,0:21:48.81,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,you think you can do whatever you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.28,0:21:50.51,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,You think you'll stay
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.51,0:21:52.68,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,a queen without her clan?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.68,0:21:54.21,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,The Dowager Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.11,0:21:57.25,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,I do not rely on my clan or my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.32,0:22:00.55,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,I do whatever I want because I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.56,0:22:11.86,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,Exactly. Chief Eunuch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.13,0:22:14.30,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.30,0:22:16.74,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,I neglected my duty
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.74,0:22:18.70,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,produce an heir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.84,0:22:22.68,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,I think this is unacceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.24,0:22:25.58,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,So go and report to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.88,0:22:31.35,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,Report?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.18,0:22:35.02,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,I don’t know what you’re talking about, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.92,0:22:39.26,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,You know, you always do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.30,0:22:44.56,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.53,0:22:47.17,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,I should punish you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.60,0:22:51.80,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.17,0:22:54.64,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,-Kill me.\N-What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.47,0:22:57.28,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,I didn’t tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.98,0:23:07.65,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,Now my life is in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.32,0:23:10.09,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,I don’t need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.66,0:23:12.49,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,What should I do with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.29,0:23:16.23,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,Please kill me, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.23,0:23:18.03,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,God. I said it's not necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.70,0:23:24.30,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,I know you had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.70,0:23:26.34,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,You must follow orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.81,0:23:35.81,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,It would be better if you were angry with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.95,0:23:39.62,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,This is worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.29,0:23:46.33,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,How can you be a spy if you are so easily scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.86,0:23:51.43,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,I need to go somewhere before the meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.20,0:23:54.10,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,Go to Injeongjeong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.87,0:23:59.64,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,God, can you read this somewhere else?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.64,0:24:01.57,Default,hazelnut,0,0,0,,The chief eunuch was so scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.16,0:24:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you slept well.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.67,0:24:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So you say hello to your elders?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.94,0:24:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The studs are very heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.14,0:24:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t bow my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.54,0:24:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Rituals are held in this sacred place and ancestors are remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.11,0:24:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s not appropriate to come here hung with decorations.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.65,0:24:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Before issuing a return, you need to clean the feathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.22,0:24:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, I completely forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.86,0:24:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to light incense for the deceased king.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.73,0:24:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And how could I disgrace the Chonghak teaching on etiquette.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.37,0:25:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.94,0:25:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I am an ardent follower of Confucianism.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.74,0:25:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t stand unfulfilled rituals.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.84,0:25:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you not to touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.68,0:25:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You left something in my chambers.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.98,0:25:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They showed up without warning and poked their nose into my affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.56,0:25:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,About the same as now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.56,0:25:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.96,0:25:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Told you the same thing. Return.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.16,0:25:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I suffered a lot here - I need to return everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.80,0:25:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of rude words are you talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.27,0:25:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Slander your elders
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.34,0:25:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and complain about life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.44,0:25:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You have always been like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.74,0:25:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,but today your temper has crossed all boundaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.38,0:25:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn’t it because you grew up without a mother’s hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.49,0:25:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, mother-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.02,0:25:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If I’m rude, since I grew up without a mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.83,0:26:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,then you are impudent because you did not raise your child?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.66,0:26:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.90,0:26:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is so annoying that I can’t stand the heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.77,0:26:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Portrait of your dearest son
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.84,0:26:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,almost burned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.54,0:26:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.18,0:26:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, for sure and irrevocably.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.75,0:26:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Of all the crazy people, I am the most rabid.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.19,0:26:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So go and look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.76,0:26:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if a hair falls from my head,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.47,0:26:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and you won’t see your son anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.49,0:27:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The queen wasn’t the one to worry about,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.54,0:27:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and about all the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.05,0:27:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The best defense is an attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.74,0:27:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, I didn’t notice that you were here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.57,0:27:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There are ghost people.\NThey walk around and don’t shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.94,0:28:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m throwing pancakes into the pond here.\NDo you want to come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.45,0:28:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.18,0:28:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Account book.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.85,0:28:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You took it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.22,0:28:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of her, I almost died.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.50,0:28:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.57,0:28:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you achieve this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.40,0:28:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You really didn’t kill Ovol?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.37,0:28:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what I say, you only believe what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.21,0:28:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I must take the king from you,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.04,0:28:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,kill Ovol and throw her body into the well.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.21,0:28:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I will become a villain who deserves to die,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.28,0:28:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and you are an innocent victim, saint.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.82,0:28:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This is why playing the victim is dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.49,0:28:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Slowly turning into a monster -
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.83,0:28:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and you yourself don’t notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.65,0:29:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Look in the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.65,0:29:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,See your ugliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.64,0:29:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on yourself if you want to get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.21,0:29:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No mood for good deeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.50,0:29:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,When I fell into the water before your eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.90,0:30:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,most likely,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.37,0:30:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,you could have extended your hand to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.94,0:30:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This proves
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.25,0:30:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,that as a person I am better than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.53,0:30:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Kim Jwageun, troop commander,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.10,0:30:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,left his post.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.10,0:30:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.01,0:30:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Resignation was delayed,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.84,0:30:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you could all repent for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.11,0:30:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.15,0:30:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I misspoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.78,0:30:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.72,0:30:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Next question.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.16,0:31:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But first I want to announce something.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.70,0:31:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I will create an agency that will deal with the system of three taxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.80,0:31:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be called Samjeong Lijeongjeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.77,0:31:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Samjeong lijongjeong?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.21,0:31:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It will create laws
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.34,0:31:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and will develop plans to resolve
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.51,0:31:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,the main shortcomings of the three-tax system.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.55,0:31:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The country lives off agriculture.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.69,0:31:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The peasants prosper, so does she.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.76,0:31:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Officials fleecing ordinary farmers,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.83,0:31:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- a threat to the state.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.36,0:31:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Their atrocities will be regarded as treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.07,0:31:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Before creating a new department\Nyou need to study everything carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.10,0:31:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,At least listen to our opinion before...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.51,0:31:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not make concessions,\Ndoing what I must.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.41,0:31:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This means,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.31,0:31:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,that your opinion no longer matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.22,0:32:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I will also give to the late King Seongjong
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.86,0:32:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sunjo's posthumous name, as required by tradition.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.17,0:32:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty is more assertive than usual today.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.05,0:32:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.85,0:32:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a new appointment today.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.92,0:32:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The chief secretary misspoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.62,0:32:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We are talking about proposing a candidacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.72,0:32:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The place of the Minister of War is free.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.06,0:32:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A weak army will lead to a crisis throughout the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.50,0:32:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So I insist that you approve
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.80,0:32:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,candidate selected by the military council.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.97,0:32:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The Minister of War is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.86,0:33:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Kim Byonin, Minister of War,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.47,0:33:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,greets Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.75,0:33:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Kim Byunin can be dangerous - he is supported by the Cho family.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.39,0:33:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And Cho, and Kim
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.59,0:33:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,asked for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.96,0:33:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be his doing too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.39,0:33:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t think we can turn a blind eye to their requests.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.83,0:33:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This could give the aristocrats a reason to revolt.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.04,0:33:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you are free to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.54,0:34:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.31,0:34:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But it is still difficult to stop their attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.21,0:34:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The best defense is an attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.61,0:34:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Need to strike
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.01,0:34:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,faster than the opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.45,0:34:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no time to recruit more soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.82,0:34:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to take care of Lijonchon.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.42,0:34:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hon, I'll send you
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.62,0:34:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,to 3 cities in the south.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.09,0:34:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,People there are indignant - start an investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.30,0:34:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Another business trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.60,0:34:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, for my sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.17,0:34:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The further into the forest, the more you both sit here and give out orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.01,0:34:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like all the running is on me. Or am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.84,0:34:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only on you. I always...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.68,0:34:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're done with the investigation,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.52,0:34:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-I could give you a vacation.\N-I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.15,0:34:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.56,0:34:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.26,0:34:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt he heard it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.89,0:34:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.50,0:35:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.20,0:35:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.34,0:35:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t kill you, come closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.55,0:35:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen has sent you a letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.79,0:35:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.36,0:35:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Shaking like an autumn leaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.54,0:35:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Revenge wasn't what I thought.\NIt should have been more fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.11,0:35:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,How exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.41,0:35:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm shaking all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.86,0:35:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.80,0:36:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.54,0:36:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Today you are especially beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.28,0:36:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It suits you very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.94,0:36:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything suits a pretty face.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.81,0:36:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll be a beauty even in cast-offs.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.98,0:36:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knew that I would become a great queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.79,0:36:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll never get used to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.19,0:36:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked for a meeting,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.00,0:36:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,to propose an alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.60,0:36:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Rod probably left me,\Nthinking that now I'm at the same time with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.87,0:36:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I have nothing to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.50,0:36:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If you choose my side,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.77,0:36:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,the Kim family will become your enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.84,0:36:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They cheated on me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.98,0:36:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll throw them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.41,0:36:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A common enemy is not a reason to unite?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.82,0:37:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.19,0:37:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No social distancing from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.73,0:37:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. You can touch everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.30,0:37:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,In films about bandits
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.54,0:37:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw my buddies mixing blood in a cup and drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.14,0:37:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But blood is somehow unhygienic.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.51,0:37:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's celebrate our union with tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.81,0:37:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Simple and tasteful.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.99,0:37:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.66,0:37:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this how the allies drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.13,0:37:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, for brotherhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.03,0:37:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-To the bottom.\N-What...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.94,0:37:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we are brothers, let's make everything clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.21,0:38:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you want to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.35,0:38:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.75,0:38:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This is worth discussing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.89,0:38:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We thought you heard our conversation
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.76,0:38:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,about the assassination attempt on your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.86,0:38:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still your father-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.83,0:38:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,For me, he was one of the corrupt officials.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.93,0:38:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartless.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.87,0:38:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is clear with you.\NAnd he didn’t spare his own wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.30,0:38:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Serial killer Kimov.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.74,0:38:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.81,0:38:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I know my apologies won’t change much,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.91,0:38:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,but there was so much misunderstanding between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.15,0:38:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.02,0:38:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You will owe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.58,0:38:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t forgive you until you return the favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.29,0:38:43.89,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,So what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.26,0:38:45.36,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Strengthen your power?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.36,0:38:49.63,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,This is just a way to restore our destroyed country.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.73,0:38:53.40,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I don’t think that the foundations of society can be easily changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.97,0:38:56.53,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Honestly, I like the method more than the goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.84,0:38:58.77,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,If you strengthen your power,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.34,0:39:01.14,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,then no one will get to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.71,0:39:05.24,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I am well aware of the fear of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.21,0:39:10.01,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I know you're being rude,\Nbut you must be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.68,0:39:11.68,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I don’t know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.15,0:39:14.05,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,Maybe because she was already dying?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.05,0:39:15.85,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,For me, neglect is worse than death.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.79,0:39:20.19,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,If I can give a thrashing to all those who disdain me,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.69,0:39:23.50,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,then I will die smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.10,0:39:27.17,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.57,0:39:30.10,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,It's time to cook dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.10,0:39:32.34,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Yes. Well then
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.94,0:39:35.34,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I leave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.46,0:39:54.39,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I will die smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.36,0:39:56.86,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,"I'll die smiling."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.58,0:40:16.41,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,-Mr. Kim.\N-Byonin.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.18,0:40:19.82,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,That is, the Minister of War.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.49,0:40:23.35,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,-Are you kidding me?\N-What are you, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.76,0:40:25.52,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Please call me by name.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.76,0:40:28.09,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,Actually, I was waiting for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.19,0:40:32.40,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,because I wanted to talk to you about the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.63,0:40:37.87,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,By the way, I also have something to tell you about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.28,0:40:51.82,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,Where did I put this?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.42,0:40:54.85,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,Where to?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.19,0:41:00.19,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,-Wait.\N-I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.66,0:41:06.66,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.20,0:41:10.74,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,How dare you use a knife? \NYou've been here for almost a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.20,0:41:15.07,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Now everything has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.07,0:41:19.64,Default,tira,0,0,0,,Lately, cooks refuse to drink makgeolli after work.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.64,0:41:22.01,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,They constantly say “no” and “no”.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.01,0:41:24.82,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I said that I would treat them, but they still refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.82,0:41:25.82,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Go and understand them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.35,0:41:30.86,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I don’t understand these court ladies either.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.76,0:41:35.89,Default,dash,0,0,0,,Told them to come later, and they really came later.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.89,0:41:38.73,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,They should have arrived in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.50,0:41:41.17,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,-Well, what kind of children have they gone.\N-Well, what kind of children have gone on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.84,0:41:45.97,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,To the Dongmyeongjong hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.61,0:41:54.61,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.65,0:41:57.68,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,One more thing left to take revenge on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.38,0:41:59.58,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Recipe for revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.92,0:42:06.06,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I can answer him the same, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.62,0:42:08.46,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,An eye for an eye. A tooth for a tooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.86,0:42:10.40,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Masculinity for male dignity.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.80,0:42:14.20,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,Then fern?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.70,0:42:17.57,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,-Beaded plant?\N-Fern and beaded plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.57,0:42:19.87,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,This recipe has a lot of useful ingredients.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.31,0:42:22.27,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,So I will go forever towards my goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.61,0:42:24.18,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,This is too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.44,0:42:27.71,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,Let's go all in.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.01,0:42:31.98,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,-Castration.\N-Castration?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.45,0:42:34.62,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I didn’t hear...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.86,0:42:39.49,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.19,0:42:41.43,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,Such a valuable ingredient.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.06,0:42:47.83,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I don’t want to burden you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.43,0:42:51.24,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I know when to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.84,0:42:53.14,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.20,0:42:54.34,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Don't apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.37,0:43:00.11,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Can I ask you just one question?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.75,0:43:02.75,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,-Yes.\N-Why do you
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.65,0:43:05.85,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,don’t like purposeful men?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.42,0:43:12.52,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,In the palace I saw a lot of purposeful people
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.59,0:43:15.89,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,and how hard it was for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.43,0:43:17.96,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I'm afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.63,0:43:20.33,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,and I don’t want this for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.13,0:43:24.74,Default,dash,0,0,0,,Thanks for your reply.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.05,0:43:38.22,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Everything I would dare to want from you,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.68,0:43:41.62,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,so that you always
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.92,0:43:44.12,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,smiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.52,0:43:45.92,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.60,0:43:51.60,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Apparently, this is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.60,0:43:53.87,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,You really have a keen eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.23,0:43:55.47,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,You understood everything right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.63,0:43:58.67,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,How could I not understand when you cry like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.27,0:44:01.47,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Don't look.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.08,0:44:07.41,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I don’t want to be seen like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.65,0:44:10.98,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,Then go around the corner and cry there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.98,0:44:13.42,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,People will still decide that it’s because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.32,0:44:15.55,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,It’s not because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.76,0:44:20.36,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I won't cry anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.36,0:44:24.76,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Being able to completely get rid of feelings is part of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.23,0:44:29.17,Default,dash,0,0,0,,This may be harder than continuing to love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.00,0:44:31.57,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,You are quite a poet.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.64,0:44:34.94,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,Let's go. Don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.31,0:44:44.02,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,Did she send me food on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.16,0:44:53.89,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,What is this ominous drawing?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.89,0:44:57.50,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,How beautiful it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.13,0:45:00.73,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,Court lady Chon, even poison wouldn’t take you,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.83,0:45:02.50,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,you're so slow to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.94,0:45:06.27,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Why are you suddenly praising me?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.59,0:45:26.89,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.59,0:45:32.90,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,I, Simon of the Khan family, have come to greet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.90,0:45:39.77,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Have we never met before?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.61,0:45:45.88,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I'm so grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.81,0:45:49.51,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,That is, I... Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.75,0:45:53.15,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I think you should tell me something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.48,0:45:54.69,Default,dash,0,0,0,,For example,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.89,0:45:57.92,Default,dash,0,0,0,,"I deserve to die."
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.19,0:46:02.56,Default,dash,0,0,0,,Because of you, I spilled all the popcorn I worked so hard on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.86,0:46:05.00,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Scattered when you sent him flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.70,0:46:09.60,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I had no idea that there was a queen in front of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.64,0:46:14.57,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I committed a serious crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.71,0:46:18.24,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I had no idea it was me?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.48,0:46:21.48,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,Then why did you run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.48,0:46:23.58,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Well, that's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.58,0:46:26.32,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Such a noble man ran after me,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.32,0:46:28.05,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,so I was surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.49,0:46:31.72,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I had no other reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.82,0:46:32.92,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.53,0:46:39.53,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,In truth, I called you,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.83,0:46:44.70,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,to give you a place at court.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.67,0:46:49.71,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,A good place where you definitely won’t be kicked out
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.71,0:46:50.78,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,and they will pay well.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.41,0:46:53.98,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,But you have to lose something.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.01,0:46:56.08,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.92,0:46:59.28,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,Are you saying I’m going to lose something?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.95,0:47:03.86,Default,tira,0,0,0,,When I met you, even if it was short-lived,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.09,0:47:05.89,Default,tira,0,0,0,,understood that this position is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.89,0:47:07.43,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I am so grateful to you, queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.13,0:47:12.20,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.30,0:47:14.77,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,you will become a eunuch.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.97,0:47:16.07,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.50,0:47:19.54,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Wait. Just a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.54,0:47:21.81,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Let me go. Hands off.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.64,0:47:24.71,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.08,0:47:26.74,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Please have mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.74,0:47:28.48,Default,dash,0,0,0,,Thank you for your boundless generosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.48,0:47:30.65,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,But why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.08,0:47:33.08,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,First of all,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.08,0:47:35.65,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,you have faked your identity as a nobleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.45,0:47:38.26,Default,dash,0,0,0,,No. It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.29,0:47:40.86,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,The social structure is to blame for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.03,0:47:42.46,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.83,0:47:44.90,Default,dash,0,0,0,,First. Firstly,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.20,0:47:46.96,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,poisoned the water in the royal kitchen
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.96,0:47:49.07,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,and disrupted the royal feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.53,0:47:51.67,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Secondly,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.07,0:47:53.74,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,your descendant is a terrible person.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.07,0:47:56.07,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Descendant?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.27,0:47:59.61,Default,dash,0,0,0,,Are you sure you haven’t mixed it up with my ancestor?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.48,0:48:01.55,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.65,0:48:03.75,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.85,0:48:09.29,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,Your descendant is a terrible person.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.69,0:48:11.02,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Descendant?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.26,0:48:13.49,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.49,0:48:15.46,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,I will become a eunuch - there will be no descendants.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.46,0:48:17.93,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,I will become a eunuch - there will be no descendants. Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.90,0:48:21.23,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I will not have descendants.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.33,0:48:23.33,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,Do you have descendants? No?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.43,0:48:26.04,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I will not have any descendants!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.04,0:48:29.37,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,How so. Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.91,0:48:38.52,Default,shooting range,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, the Minister of War has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.73,0:48:49.96,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.63,0:48:52.06,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,Andon clan Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.36,0:48:54.27,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're all in cahoots.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.97,0:48:57.10,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,But my dad is also from the Andon family of Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.27,0:49:00.47,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,What? I just called him “my dad.”
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.71,0:49:05.81,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Transferring emotions is dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.11,0:49:11.12,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I found out what happened to you after our meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.72,0:49:14.12,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I didn't know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.65,0:49:16.15,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,You didn’t know,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.79,0:49:18.09,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,that they tried to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.09,0:49:21.19,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,I am not on my father's side, and I do not belong to the Kim family.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.09,0:49:24.63,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,However, you are not free from your father and family.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.63,0:49:28.33,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Eventually you will understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.68,0:49:42.55,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,Enemy or ally?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.99,0:49:55.69,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,How dare he do this to Soyeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.30,0:50:04.14,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Moreover, how could he do this to the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.41,0:50:09.01,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Kim Jwageun, bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.91,0:50:11.31,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.75,0:50:23.22,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Besides, this Samjeong Lijeongjeong.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.22,0:50:26.99,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,They use official corruption as an excuse,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.99,0:50:29.69,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,to try to destroy our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.69,0:50:31.03,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.66,0:50:34.23,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,If they see this as an appropriation of someone else’s,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.23,0:50:36.07,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,then no one is innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.07,0:50:39.44,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,To protect yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.70,0:50:41.94,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,they will try to protect officials.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.17,0:50:45.81,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,All that will remain of Samjeong Lijeongjeong is its outer shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.15,0:50:51.15,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,Even if you join them for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.15,0:50:53.98,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,keep your eyes on the Queen Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.45,0:50:56.85,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,She can smile in your face,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.85,0:50:58.96,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,but she is always ready to stick a knife in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.89,0:51:01.36,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I'll remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.26,0:51:03.49,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Court lady Chon.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.23,0:51:06.10,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.83,0:51:09.33,Default,shooting gallery,0,0,0,,Remove the table and call the healer.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.57,0:51:11.20,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.04,0:51:16.51,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,Have you eaten yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.44,0:51:19.24,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I have no appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.14,0:51:22.08,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,I heard you liked the food,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.08,0:51:23.85,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,cooked by the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.12,0:51:26.88,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,She wasn't that good.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.98,0:51:29.12,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,She was edible.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.55,0:51:31.96,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,The Queen is grieving now.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.49,0:51:36.29,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,Said that the main concubine
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.29,0:51:39.30,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,came between you and made her believe that the family turned against her.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.63,0:51:41.47,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,She blames herself for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.83,0:51:45.04,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,Chief concubine?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.04,0:51:47.10,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,The queen's father told me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.47,0:51:49.81,Default,shooting,0,0,0,,It was not the queen who deceived you,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.04,0:51:52.28,Default,tyra,0,0,0,,and the main concubine.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.79,0:52:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The King has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.76,0:52:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask him to enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.40,0:52:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.70,0:52:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the late visit without warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.30,0:52:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.74,0:52:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,At any time it is a great honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.94,0:52:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.78,0:52:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.12,0:52:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,About the body of a court maid recently found in a well.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.95,0:52:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This was done by order of the Queen Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.09,0:52:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.89,0:52:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But why does she...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.46,0:52:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You also can’t understand the reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.90,0:52:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If so, that's for sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.54,0:52:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Cannot be Ovol.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.97,0:52:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is impossible. This is definitely Ovol.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.71,0:52:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard it was in such a state that it was difficult to identify.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.98,0:53:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you decide that it was Ovol?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.55,0:53:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,She was dressed as a court lady,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.71,0:53:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and of the court ladies, only Ovol disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.75,0:53:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,She knew that you would think it was Ovol.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.43,0:53:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen Mother wants,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.09,0:53:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,so that you rely on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.20,0:53:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But why was the well used?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.30,0:53:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I told her what I went through in the well.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.97,0:53:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That I met you in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.71,0:53:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And that this place hurts me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.91,0:53:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He reminded me of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.68,0:53:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,so I was sure that I had lost someone dear to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.42,0:53:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I understand that you cannot carelessly reveal your pain
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.16,0:53:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,to anyone in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.84,0:54:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Immerse the queen in the nightmare in which I live.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.62,0:54:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust the Queen Mother no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.82,0:54:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We must hide what we all know,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.13,0:54:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,so don’t let her know that you know what she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.63,0:54:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,She betrayed me and I am deeply disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.80,0:54:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well for me
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.30,0:54:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,source of fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.04,0:54:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe she used that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.29,0:54:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like poker and hato.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.73,0:54:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Chat and games -
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.93,0:55:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,the best way to pass the time and life.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.73,0:55:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.63,0:55:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We were afraid that Damhyang would make you feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.57,0:55:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.01,0:55:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. She's in a good place now.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.71,0:55:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? She had to go to a good place, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.88,0:55:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Damhyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.02,0:55:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that’s not what I’m talking about. She's really in a good place.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.56,0:55:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.56,0:55:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Damhyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.00,0:55:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,She said she really moved to a good place.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.40,0:55:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.27,0:55:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.67,0:55:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.14,0:55:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t even say goodbye to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.41,0:55:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Damhyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.12,0:55:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-Damhyan.\N-Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.72,0:55:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Damhyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.49,0:56:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.73,0:56:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.50,0:56:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.90,0:56:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.10,0:56:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.31,0:56:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.71,0:56:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-Damhyan.\N-Damhyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.65,0:56:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,All-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.85,0:56:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,How did the Queen Mother get her hands on the ledger?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.89,0:56:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The book we were looking for so hard, but missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.92,0:56:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I can win her over to your side?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.26,0:56:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.23,0:56:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hearing that she overtook us, freely leaving the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.40,0:56:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm disappointed in myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.80,0:56:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen Mother is in the Seongwonjong Hall almost\N all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.17,0:56:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t understand how she got the ledger.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.81,0:56:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That, that she did with the body,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.01,0:56:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,means that she has accomplices.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.75,0:57:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should make them our accomplices?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.85,0:57:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The portrait of the one in the tokkebi mask is not ready yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.02,0:57:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been too busy these days,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.86,0:57:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,freeing Damhyang's mother from slavery
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.22,0:57:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and looking for her father.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.33,0:57:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But you never found him?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.93,0:57:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How to find someone hiding in the mountains?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.60,0:57:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He probably became a bandit.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.00,0:57:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thinking about vacation after my trip as a royal investigator,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.01,0:57:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I can barely stand these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.51,0:57:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I meant...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.49,0:57:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you make me a secret inspector instead of a royal investigator?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.09,0:57:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is cooler.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.66,0:57:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,In disguise, I would suddenly take out a token, like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.23,0:57:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you are a born secret inspector. Do as you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.23,0:57:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,One more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.43,0:58:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t think Youngjin is that kind of person.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.10,0:58:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Only Kim Jwageun deserved to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.20,0:58:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A Youngjin -
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.87,0:58:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,my whole family.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.99,0:58:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you'll sleep here after that,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.92,0:58:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,how did you almost kill your father-in-law and wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.36,0:58:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently not.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.24,0:59:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.98,0:59:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This hurts my pride.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.55,1:00:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like she was under water for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.25,1:00:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand how painful this must be.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.95,1:00:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact that her body was found in a well is either a terrible coincidence,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.06,1:00:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,or someone wants to push us over.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.28,1:00:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm deep in thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.21,1:00:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be very shocked.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.98,1:00:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Too much space for me here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.02,1:01:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you feel lonely and lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.99,1:01:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I found the maid who sold the noriga that you gave Ovol.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.49,1:01:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,She said she found him in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.70,1:01:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.96,1:01:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the same maid who threw the body into the well
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.60,1:01:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,by order of the Queen Mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.67,1:01:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ovol is alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.60,1:01:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,She was attacked in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.34,1:01:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,She didn’t even have time to take a step outside the palace.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.91,1:01:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn’t you hope that the body,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.95,1:01:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,found in the well, didn’t belong to Ovol?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.35,1:01:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you be happy,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.42,1:01:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,that it wasn’t Ovol?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.95,1:01:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you believe that this is Ovol?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.66,1:01:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,For God's sake...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.69,1:01:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,For God's sake, what are you hiding?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.23,1:01:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Last time
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.67,1:01:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,what you passed
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.08,1:01:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen Mother?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.19,1:02:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see everything?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.29,1:02:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.32,1:02:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t see anything without your permission.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.57,1:02:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone goes astray from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.94,1:02:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You still have a chance to get back on the right track.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.14,1:02:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I lost my way a long time ago?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.78,1:02:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Still Can
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.21,1:02:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,get back on the right track?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.75,1:02:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no turning back.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.69,1:02:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.92,1:02:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That body must be Ovol.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.80,1:02:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you cook samhyang ramen
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.84,1:03:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,in the middle of the night?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.01,1:03:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you want it most at night?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.58,1:03:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that in the morning your face will swell.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.68,1:03:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But it’s so hard to fight temptation.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.49,1:03:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You tried so hard, it’s a pity that it was in vain.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.09,1:03:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dowager Queen at Night
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.29,1:03:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,does not eat.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.90,1:03:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So instead let me...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.87,1:03:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.86,1:03:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You must warn me about your arrival.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.23,1:04:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn’t you even knock?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.94,1:04:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to eat some ramen before we leave?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.41,1:04:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What is ramen? And where do you want me to go?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.82,1:04:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No pressure. This is just research.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.96,1:04:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Or test.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.12,1:04:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I shouldn’t do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.23,1:04:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But if only a little...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.80,1:04:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.00,1:04:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ramen has such an addictive taste.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.13,1:04:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you start, it’s impossible to stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.84,1:04:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.71,1:04:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Internal conflict.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.55,1:04:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What would you do if you were me?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.52,1:04:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you eat ramen or not?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.69,1:04:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I would first explain what ramen is.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.76,1:05:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-For starters...\N-What?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.46,1:05:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.20,1:05:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.73,1:05:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You will only understand what it is when you try it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.87,1:05:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like air when you get drunk,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.81,1:05:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,or when you're angry,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.34,1:05:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,or realize that it is
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.58,1:05:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,reality.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.55,1:05:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we speaking the same language now?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.98,1:05:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.55,1:05:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We are talking about ramen.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.35,1:05:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Move closer. Ramen is good when it's hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.29,1:05:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Initial instruction for children
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.63,1:05:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you treat her?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.93,1:05:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, mommies!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.53,1:05:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What to do? This is a priceless book.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.55,1:05:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you say that this book is priceless?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.22,1:06:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How is Primary Instruction for Children valuable to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.13,1:06:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.03,1:06:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.37,1:06:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You were the one who saved me?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.27,1:06:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved me from the well?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.08,1:06:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.89,1:06:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It was me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.10,1:06:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How I became a queen
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.79,1:07:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My Cheoljong will be desperately waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.30,1:07:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is a trap?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.23,1:07:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t believe the queen challenged me to a real fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.30,1:07:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-Now is it my turn?\N-Take out your sword.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.84,1:07:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who doesn’t clean up after himself and leaves traces,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.00,1:07:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,must answer for everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.94,1:07:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I overthrew the Kim clan,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.01,1:07:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Kim Byonin's power has only strengthened.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.91,1:07:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like there is no progress.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.78,1:07:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If Cheoljong does this, the world will also change after 200 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.95,1:07:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I am on your side, you will win.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.98,1:07:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a secret weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.75,1:07:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Я знаю будущее.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.96,0:15:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,

Comment: 0,0:08:45.52,0:08:46.75,Default,Лилия,0,0,0,,LITERALLY SAYS "WITHOUT LIPS, TEETH\NARE COLD" AND MEANS THEY'RE CLOSE.
Comment: 0,0:09:01.50,0:09:02.87,Default,Лилия,0,0,0,,GRANTING AMNESTY FOR CERTAIN\NCRIMINALS FOR THEIR CRIMES
